<title>INDIA: Delhi grain market closed for Sikh festival.</title>
<headline>Delhi grain market closed for Sikh festival.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The foodgrain, oil and other commodities markets in New Delhi were closed on Monday as traders observed a Sikh festival.</p>
<p>The markets were shut for the birth anniversary of Guru Nanak Dev, traders said.</p>
</text>
